'''Watergun''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2024 Summer Box]] in the [[Summer Event 2024]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has ended.

==Appearance==
Its cylinder is mainly green with orange spots on the top and bottom of it, the water barrel is mainly orange (with some green spots on it) and is partially inserted in the cylinder. The toggle pin is orange, with it's outer structure being green, while the outer grip handle is green and also striped. Finally, the inner grip handle is orange with some darker stripes.

==Trivia==
*It has a [[Chroma Weapons|chroma]] counterpart under the name [[Chroma Watergun]].
*This is the first Summer weapon that can be obtained from a Summer Box.
*It is commonly partnered with the [[Common Weapons|common]] knife [[Toy (Knife)|Toy]], however, it is not considered a set.

